<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνόη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Oenoë,</i> name of two Attic demes,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλὴ Ἱπποθοωντίς,</span> on the 
				Boeot.
			 frontier near Eleutherae, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.16
			</span></i>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνώνη</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλὴ Αἰαντίς,</span> near Marathon ;
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνόη</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰναῖοι τὴν χαράδραν,</span> prov. of
			self-inflicted ruin, <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				5.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> : loc. pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνόησι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.845.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰναῖος,</span> belonging to one of
			these demes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.99
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1623.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1926.130
			</span></i>, etc. ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνοαῖος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					541
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				3
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
